{"title":"2000 SMT/Calculus Problems","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Problem_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Problem_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Problem_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Problem_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Problem_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 6</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Problem_7\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 7</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Problem_8\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 8</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Problem_9\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 9</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Problem_10\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 10</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">15</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\">Problem 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_SMT/Calculus_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the slope of the tangent at the point of inflection of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/4/9042f2b1caa09739c2040e278ce92a10b69c0c8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = x^3 - 3x^2 + 6x + 2000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"203\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_SMT/Calculus_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2000 SMT/Calculus Problems/Problem 1\">Solution</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_SMT/Calculus_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/6/866cbdf7c9951f8c21e8a2c30ea299774b1d9988.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y = x^3 - 3x^2 + 6x + 2000\\]\" width=\"199\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>First derivative:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/1/f9124eb232b887d54e71ebffed8ad4af5d08ec81.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{dy}{dx} = 3x^2 - 6x + 6\\]\" width=\"145\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Second derivative:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/e/ebe1489ea47af617a34339c4369a366f26ea8546.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2} = 6x - 6\\]\" width=\"103\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>Point of inflection occurs when:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/9/4b93d38e379dff6f4409ac6d87240043a5b214ac.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[6x - 6 = 0\\]\" width=\"83\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/3/94310ae986fd19878ca259e81cb368df3b450dcb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x = 1\\]\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>Slope at this point:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/2/e128bd2869ad1550a49117bb570061b5b29d67bc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left.\\frac{dy}{dx}\\right|_{x=1} = 3(1)^2 - 6(1) + 6\\]\" width=\"202\" height=\"44\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/e/20ee54addba2c9d8f527a7dc3d0e0c5d3ba62543.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[= 3 - 6 + 6 = 3\\]\" width=\"122\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/7/a974edd3f6b492c4f3e5ce4be174652df1f3b226.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\boxed{3}\\]\" width=\"21\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=~Trashboycan\" title=\"~Trashboycan\">~Trashboycan</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\">Problem 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_SMT/Calculus_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Karen is attempting to climb a rope that is not securely fastened. If she pulls herself up <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> feet at once, then the rope slips <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/5/48524d3889ec8433cb03669176e738011df245b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3$\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" /> feet down. How many feet at a time must she pull herself up to climb with as few pulls as possible?\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_SMT/Calculus_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2000 SMT/Calculus Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_3\">Problem 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_SMT/Calculus_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A rectangle of length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/a/5eaada580cd5b1e93ab02c6a80a00b8a9d28a1bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{4} \\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"23\" height=\"37\" /> and height 4 is bisected by the x-axis and is in the first and fourth quadrants, with the leftmost edge on the y-axis. The graph of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/3/853e6103881e6e7f259853e587c05c8ab6e41255.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin(x) + C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"83\" height=\"18\" /> divides the area of the square in half. What is C?\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_SMT/Calculus_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2000 SMT/Calculus Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_4\">Problem 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_SMT/Calculus_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For what value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/9/6b967317d29c3482d54b14b287b7081133e7d380.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0 &lt; x &lt; \\frac{\\pi}{2})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"95\" height=\"33\" /> does <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/0/ce0601f0228468f4437cba81c862cec97fd45028.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan x + \\cot x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"101\" height=\"15\" /> achieve its minimum?\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_SMT/Calculus_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2000 SMT/Calculus Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Solution</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_2\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_SMT/Calculus_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/1/dd121f72010613682de6f999325e1dace61319cb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\displaystyle \\text{We differentiate the function } \\tan x + \\cot x \\text{ to get } \\frac{d}{dx}(\\tan x + \\cot x) = \\sec^2 x - \\csc^2 x.\\]\" width=\"622\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/d/12d7fb3786fdb34112ff1109c024665e4bf8050f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\displaystyle \\text{For a minimum, we set the derivative equal to zero: } \\sec^2 x - \\csc^2 x = 0.\\]\" width=\"533\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/e/9ae6d908a5e1b85253ae58d922e632f3b585c39a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\displaystyle \\text{Solving this equation under the constraint } 0 &lt; x &lt; 90^\\circ, \\text{ we find } x = 45^\\circ.\\]\" width=\"541\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/1/0f13ccdee15cf8fc1f7a774c53c19ec63b3815d4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\displaystyle \\text{Substituting } x = 45^\\circ \\text{ into the original function gives the minimum value } \\tan 45^\\circ + \\cot 45^\\circ = 2.\\]\" width=\"696\" height=\"16\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_5\">Problem 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_SMT/Calculus_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/d/6bda5706a3ac4b451919dc932d49cb10141e359e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1 &lt; x &lt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"90\" height=\"12\" /> let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/4/b945dc06b423111b1fdef141db277f181d134993.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = \\sum_{i=1}^{\\infty} \\frac{x^i}{i}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"106\" height=\"48\" />. Find a closed form expression (a closed form expression is one\nnot involving summation)for f.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_SMT/Calculus_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2000 SMT/Calculus Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_6\">Problem 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_SMT/Calculus_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A hallway of width 6 feet meets a hallway of width <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/e/96ec10e9a473e34cd3aa92cc785c2bd44638a3bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6\\sqrt{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> feet at right angles. Find the length of the longest pipe that can be carried horizontally around this corner.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_SMT/Calculus_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2000 SMT/Calculus Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_7\">Problem 7</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_SMT/Calculus_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 7\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>An envelope of a set of lines is a curve tangent to all of them. What is the envelope of the family of lines y = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/6/a06fca0c68a1aa457351ae2280d0fe87bd227216.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{x_0} + x(1 - \\frac{1}{x_0^{2}})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"124\" height=\"42\" />, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/f/17f1249ad95b7682b8316ad21de8ce4ee9fdcf93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" /> ranging over the positive real numbers?\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_SMT/Calculus_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2000 SMT/Calculus Problems/Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_8\">Problem 8</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_SMT/Calculus_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 8\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/2/5122995b2d9b77e0a4258b7c669214febf71dd5c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} ln$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"49\" height=\"44\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/5/865211471c7cc8aff3d88f9f2b843bd262159050.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin \\theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"36\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/c/7ec7751f35863767a4d88574c73c357e97498cec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d\\theta$\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_SMT/Calculus_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2000 SMT/Calculus Problems/Problem 8 (page does not exist)\">Solution</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_3\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_SMT/Calculus_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/e/10ea27ea7c1981eaa89b7889a613d1adac37c070.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[I = \\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} \\ln(\\sin \\theta) \\, d\\theta\\]\" width=\"151\" height=\"44\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/0/b00f5afe1c646e5f0d589885e0351c9b318f32a2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{Use the identity } \\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2} - \\theta\\right) = \\cos \\theta.\\]\" width=\"281\" height=\"33\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/2/5e23f8e7035c7cf718b5bc97cb15b6e2e6d9f6be.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{Then } I = \\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} \\ln(\\sin(\\frac{\\pi}{2} - \\theta)) \\, d\\theta = \\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} \\ln(\\cos \\theta) \\, d\\theta\\]\" width=\"387\" height=\"44\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/6/8b6d2ad070bfc2b5da03c5404f43c3232dc8b79c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{Add the two expressions for } I: \\quad 2I = \\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} \\ln(\\sin \\theta) \\, d\\theta + \\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} \\ln(\\cos \\theta) \\, d\\theta = \\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} \\ln(\\sin \\theta \\cos \\theta) \\, d\\theta\\]\" width=\"725\" height=\"44\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/8/2e85c2a53f08c2d0883ba8259dbd188a0278523a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{Use the identity } \\sin \\theta \\cos \\theta = \\frac{1}{2} \\sin 2\\theta: \\quad 2I = \\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} \\ln\\left(\\frac{1}{2} \\sin 2\\theta\\right) \\, d\\theta\\]\" width=\"517\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/6/5b65b52ded209c2c5a04b2be8720c7e523912a2f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2I = \\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} \\ln\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right) \\, d\\theta + \\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} \\ln(\\sin 2\\theta) \\, d\\theta = \\frac{\\pi}{2} \\ln\\frac{1}{2} + \\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} \\ln(\\sin 2\\theta) \\, d\\theta\\]\" width=\"529\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/1/6b127d659f0e24c38a7fc86f985bbe504c2faf97.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{Substitute } \\phi = 2\\theta, \\, d\\phi = 2 d\\theta, \\, \\theta = 0 \\implies \\phi = 0, \\, \\theta = \\frac{\\pi}{2} \\implies \\phi = \\pi: \\quad \\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} \\ln(\\sin 2\\theta) \\, d\\theta = \\frac{1}{2} \\int_0^{\\pi} \\ln(\\sin \\phi) \\, d\\phi\\]\" width=\"836\" height=\"44\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/8/9181b840bb949c12273ba8281aa58c042999ecca.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{It is known that } \\int_0^{\\pi} \\ln(\\sin \\phi) \\, d\\phi = -\\pi \\quad \\implies \\quad \\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} \\ln(\\sin 2\\theta) \\, d\\theta = -\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\]\" width=\"556\" height=\"44\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/5/0558a413c92e7d7748fa14c5c9edf38484a80aa7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{Therefore, } 2I = \\frac{\\pi}{2} \\ln\\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{\\pi}{2} = \\frac{\\pi}{2}(-1 + \\ln\\frac{1}{2}) = \\frac{\\pi}{2}(\\ln \\frac{1}{2} - 1)\\]\" width=\"453\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/d/4edf3ca4fc23551fe269d7da8a4c51ce10ba506d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{Divide both sides by 2: } I = \\frac{\\pi}{4} (\\ln \\frac{1}{2} - 1) = \\frac{\\pi}{4} (\\ln \\frac{1}{2} - 1) = -\\frac{\\pi}{2} \\ln 2 \\quad (\\text{simplified})\\]\" width=\"582\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/f/16f9ab846a58eef52b318044f6f83638338116e8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\boxed{\\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} \\ln(\\sin \\theta) \\, d\\theta = -\\frac{\\pi}{2} \\ln 2}\\]\" width=\"213\" height=\"56\" />\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=~Trashboycan\" title=\"~Trashboycan\">~Trashboycan</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_9\">Problem 9</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_SMT/Calculus_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 9\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/8/a280be2d7ca05eb756cd61449eceba9034dfc4d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = \\sqrt{x+\\sqrt{0+\\sqrt{x+0+\\sqrt{x+\\cdots}}}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"312\" height=\"56\" /> If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/c/d1ce1cd1f0f32f165c1fb879a391d4af4138b549.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(a)=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"18\" />, find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/b/c1b2b60f586d3ab019c2feb1fc56c1de84e8a140.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f&#39;(a)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"37\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_SMT/Calculus_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2000 SMT/Calculus Problems/Problem 9\">Solution</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_4\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_SMT/Calculus_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/a/6daf6c575fbb43430b9f009771abfef9c37394a4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(x) = \\sqrt{x + \\sqrt{0 + \\sqrt{x + 0 + \\sqrt{x + \\cdots}}}}.\\]\" width=\"313\" height=\"53\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/1/e51cda18d605f4c8c9e6ff5884ef3a9a26ee8ec9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{Let the innermost repeating radical be } f(x) \\text{ itself: } f(x) = \\sqrt{x + \\sqrt{f(x)}}.\\]\" width=\"540\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/9/5192553b39e3990fae136f2c389d2616c512fd9f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{Square both sides: } f(x)^2 = x + \\sqrt{f(x)}.\\]\" width=\"296\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/4/5b49ffaf8a353b92487ed2d773600393a6ff06c5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{Differentiate both sides implicitly: } 2 f(x) f&#39;(x) = 1 + \\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{f(x)}} f&#39;(x).\\]\" width=\"505\" height=\"44\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/6/c36e6fc7fa4c4ba3aa5acf60ffc9c393298c1833.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{Solve for } f&#39;(x): f&#39;(x) = \\frac{1}{2 f(x) - \\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{f(x)}}}.\\]\" width=\"313\" height=\"52\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/7/697b2e30b35b09805b72a89b97bf62784d3a17cc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{Substitute } f(a) = 4: f&#39;(a) = \\frac{1}{2 \\cdot 4 - \\frac{1}{2 \\cdot 2}} = \\frac{4}{31}.\\]\" width=\"355\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/d/03d6bacbe56f1e36c16bee40f878a375ff8ff7db.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\boxed{f&#39;(a) = \\frac{4}{31}}\\]\" width=\"97\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=~Trashboycan\" title=\"~Trashboycan\">~Trashboycan</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_10\">Problem 10</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_SMT/Calculus_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=14\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 10\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A mirror is constructed in the shape of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/b/8cb406c21587f01d51ede86cb1ba68ecf8f13709.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pm\\sqrt{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"40\" height=\"18\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc161c7c75c65122a9ce7a9e118169cd7f0f2055.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 \\le x \\le 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/7/df7b3bf2759e157328baa87c3b360986388df339.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pm1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/8/538a028d0a22c2879454cd419c4482cb20840b6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 &lt; x &lt; 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"76\" height=\"13\" />. A ray of\nlight enters at (10,1) with slope 1. How many times does it bounce before leaving?\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_SMT/Calculus_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2000 SMT/Calculus Problems/Problem 10 (page does not exist)\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_SMT/Calculus_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=15\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Stanford_Mathematics_Tournament\" title=\"Stanford Mathematics Tournament\">Stanford Mathematics Tournament</a></li></ul>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Stanford_Mathematics_Tournament_Problems\" title=\"Stanford Mathematics Tournament Problems\">SMT Problems and Solutions</a></li></ul>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_SMT\" title=\"2000 SMT\">2000 SMT</a></li></ul>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_SMT/Calculus\" title=\"2000 SMT/Calculus\">2000 SMT/Calculus</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018044800\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 332/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 11934/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:18033:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018044800 and revision id 280605. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}